s **no self-CORROBORATED** path; unverifiable â†’ **needs_verification**.\n- Structural invariants asserted as checkable:\n  - every finding has a **non-empty location_span**;\n  - **reasoning precedes verdict**;\n  - **load_bearing is a ranked list â‰¥0** (explicitly **not pinned to 1**);\n  - must emit **what_would_change_my_conclusion** + **residual_uncertainty**;\n  - **nitpicks are capped per depth**;\n  - the **operator_wrong_pass** is present as either **found[]** or a **justified_absence**;\n  - a **\"sound/pass\" verdict requires a populated what-matters** (the anchor cuts off at \"no empty flatter[y]\", but the intent â€” no empty/flattering pass â€” is clear).\n\n## Residual decisions deferred to Stage 2 (to be pre-registered)\n- **N** â€” the hypothesis count.\n- The **nitpick cap**.\n- **LIGHT / FULL depth thresholds**.\n- The **canary pass-bar vs. a generic baseline**, plus the **run-count needed for significance**.\n- **Committed schema field types**.\n- The **operator-wrong-pass scoring rubric**.\n\nTwo caveats on grounding: the **G4** criterion and the final **non-goal** sentence are truncated in the provided anchors, so those two bullets reflect intent but not the complete locked text. If you want, I can read the actual `skills/gandalf/` and `planning/` files in the repo to reconcile this summary against the committed documents."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4276,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":24890,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d73e95f-858e-4f5e-b9a4-f1a65853eefb","uuid":"32d1bdd7-b4cc-49a8-888d-fefd679d4ad1","request_id":"req_011CcKGhJEEFAn4sLKgwdn8E"}
